# Share Easel… and an easel's Open in Cra (crabrowser.app/easel). The easel travels in the link
# itself, pictures in it (EaselShareLink); Open in Cra is a cra-easel: address with the same payload.
# Cra asks before adding anything, keeps only web links and real pictures (the javascript: link in
# this one is dropped), opens the new easel, and a page can't offer one without a click. Its sidebar
# row then has Share Easel…, which asks first (Arc's warning) and copies a crabrowser.app/easel# link,
# here to the test copy's own pasteboard. Dialogs stall ~280 ms on each show and close (AppDialog).
budget rss=700 stalls50=12
pace 0.5
env CRA_TEST_PASTEBOARD=cra.scenario.easel-share
# Pinned for the test copy: a ticked "Never show me this again." on this Mac would skip the warning.
arg -skipsShareLinkWarning
arg NO

# From another app (macOS hands the address over): asked, then added and opened.
