expect-log easel link from another app offers 5 items
cra://debug?answerDialog=Add Easel
expect-log dialog Add the “Scenario Board” Easel\? answered Add Easel
expect-log easel added: 5 items

# Its row's menu has Share Easel…; Cancel on the warning copies nothing, Copy Link to Easel copies the link.
wait 1
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=easel&run=Share Easel…
expect-log tab menu easel: .*Share Easel…
cra://debug?answerDialog=Cancel
expect-log dialog Send this Easel to anyone, on any browser\. answered Cancel: -$
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=easel-again&run=Share Easel…
cra://debug?answerDialog=Copy Link to Easel
expect-log easel share: 5 items, [0-9]+ characters, pictures full, https://crabrowser\.app/easel#

# A page's script can't offer one without a click.
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=easellink
